{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0f6c23b2abd9057b8f863371020a910af612e4e2a4e8c718a66e3ea672110810", "ja": "初めての立場", "zh": "第一次的立场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a504087663b19424cfb7b9e40d723fc06ba0252ae7aa7b3f02fbc157f13b0699", "ja": "『はるみら』のブレイクは続き、様々な番組\nに引っ張りだこに。一方、未来は春香と比べ\n個人の仕事が増えない事を気にしていた。\nプロデューサーに励まされ、元気を取り戻す\n未来。春香もまた、未来を気にかけていた。", "zh": "“春未来”的人气持续攀升，受邀参加了\n各种各样的节目。另一方面，未来很在意\n自己的个人工作并没有像春香那样增加。\n未来在制作人的鼓励下重新振作了起来。\n而春香其实也一直在关心着未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c31b5380b37b4b319b68cf164743790e53b450ccf35482746621af7ebd7a55ae", "ja": "（今日は、地上波の有名クイズ番組へのゲスト出演。\n『はるみら』はちょっとしたブレイク状態だ！）", "zh": "（今天要参加地面波电视台的知名问答节目录制，担任嘉宾。\n『春未来』正处于小小的走红期！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "1644b3a277d3b3f5e583ab447e122284a3660f409a9cec504be322511e32cf09", "ja": "む、難しかった～。\nまさかクイズ番組のゲストに呼ばれるなんて……。", "zh": "难、难死我了～  \n没想到居然会被邀请去当知识竞赛节目的嘉宾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "85d450b48af2c95a1184e37519e19b2b2266750c094681f980b1c6605491fe05", "ja": "ホントに……。\nさすがに、有名大学チームは強かったね……。", "zh": "确实……知名大学队还是很厉害啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "dbd7dba1a048ba23b947a820fd8838def4c0abb055b7ffe6a3deb9d1c6d8752d", "ja": "でも、要所で笑いも取れてたし、偶然でも\n未来がポイント取ったのもすごかったな！", "zh": "不过，我们也在关键时刻逗得大家笑了，哪怕是偶然，未来还能拿到分也很厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c39569ab23e7163a8f47ee0a777a6da83c00cc7c5edde977620a083c0b76d55", "ja": "えへへ～。ボタンの早押しには、\n自信がありますから！", "zh": "嘿嘿～我对抢答按钮还是很有自信的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "34d5c4f25561e62f0293a119323a41b0f68e286e1de2ff3f2501b88f99f6f29d", "ja": "その調子だ！　そういえば……さっきまた\n『はるみら』にオファーをもらったんだ。", "zh": "就是这个状态！对了……刚才又收到了『春未来』的工作邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "9087bbc0a485a76682de7575d03817a402b3b0ecde018eb8f31035c5a673a4b8", "ja": "わあ、やった～！！\n今度はどんなお仕事なんですか？", "zh": "哇，太好啦～！！\n这次是什么样的工作呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "00b388daf8c1fd2203e2a3638317b747f161730e1988ff8fc1c5c2b52aaffa7a", "ja": "えーと、次もテレビだな。トーク番組で、\n『おさかな宮殿』のゲストだそうだ。", "zh": "呃，下一个也是电视节目。听说是谈话节目，要去《鱼之宫殿》当嘉宾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "89e55c7eb8f6bea97493c8f045a6e5785375d57b021267cb98bfaa5f192bb084", "ja": "ええっ！？　私、テレビで見たことあります！\n{$P$}さん、他にもあるんですか？", "zh": "诶！？我在电视上见过它！\n{$P$}先生，还有其他的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "04873ce7fd64fd57efb1a404ad74f2bfb0a169dcd676ef458e71a5777c78b677", "ja": "ああ。これは、春香へのオファーだな。ただ、受けると\nその週が、結構な過密スケジュールになりそうで……。", "zh": "啊，这是给春香的邀约。不过要是接下来的话，那一周的日程恐怕会排得相当满……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "92c927ae8b94f19b073ea0b9fee7aa87cb9efd21332a442bca1bcea451793737", "ja": "ラジオのゲストに呼ばれてるんですか？\nあっ、好きな曲も流せるんですね！", "zh": "是邀请我去当电台嘉宾吗？\n啊，还可以播放自己喜欢的歌曲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "a8012797ca1929ce9231c15270330bd9ad16ca8b37c248dd9612beb95abce2a0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、大丈夫です！\n私、まだまだいけますから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，没事的！\n我还完全撑得住呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9276c6c8924d5c486324aacc3832bc8dbf47a7c67cc504e6dbc82c3ea23d838d", "ja": "そうか。それじゃ春香、\nすまないがよろしく頼む。", "zh": "这样啊。那就拜托你了，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "4d889770f91c55b4647fc45c81cb0c3828d738b616b05400031dc9c90f687e03", "ja": "はい、任せてください♪", "zh": "好的，交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "9d53eb7258fdf71d6016f18cd50d3ee3a4e9700eec5981ed015589b737fed4fa", "ja": "あのっ、{$P$}さん！\n他にオファーは……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生！\n还有其他的通告吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f268231366ffcddf907a8cc92512a0bbd46ab1b096b5bcd43c2e34a0c8ab82d5", "ja": "今のところは、これくらいかな。\nでもこの調子なら、続々オファーは来るはずだぞ。", "zh": "目前暂时就这些吧。\n不过照这个势头，邀约应该会接连不断地来才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "d1213a6ca40623ac6c6cfef9dc0eac4247a4bbafae15ad90ce4654809b8410b1", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……！", "zh": "对、对啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "62d27020116f1a8b5e1ecb06e825a80af26ee813aa15ff3de526739e4fb2a026", "ja": "さあ、波が来てる今がチャンスだ！\n『はるみら』で協力して、乗りこなしていこう！", "zh": "来吧，浪潮正盛，现在正是机会！\n让“春未来”合作起来，一起乘风破浪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1020_mc", "source_sha256": "f699b3cdf73f428587e621396456bf27fd6f7c129db102b5a74b71a651a8f169", "ja": "プチバズってますよね～、『はるみら』！\nショート動画も再生数すごかったよね？", "zh": "最近有点火起来了呢～，“はるみら”！短视频的播放量也很惊人，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1021_kohaitenisen", "source_sha256": "6e4836f3f9f5777448fd432ca31cac73591e547d8b4f50e07ea3c071de0bda9c", "ja": "私達と『はるみら』で撮ったやつですね。\nふたりとも、やっぱりリズム感がよくって。", "zh": "这是我们和“春未来”一起拍的那张吧。\n两个人果然都很有节奏感呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1022_senpaitenisen", "source_sha256": "2932176dfe3c19570c7536e11ae5d0c37af278dc6648078ebd4d086c1b928e75", "ja": "うん。でも、最後きっちり転んで、\n笑いも取っちゃうところもさすがかも。", "zh": "嗯。不过最后还稳稳地摔了一跤，连笑点都拿捏住了，不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "b5e40d5d3fe9e1e15c5dfe93708dc5435e9f113ef1cee69f13513ee4a60baf71", "ja": "いやぁ、きっちり転んだというか、\nやっぱり転んだというか……。", "zh": "哎呀，与其说是稳稳摔了一跤，\n不如说是果然又摔了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1024_hodogayaane", "source_sha256": "be439244d48a26f2233a7d203217cc947eb4da4ee910f3f52532f876e4d3faf3", "ja": "春香ちゃんはCMにも出てるのよね。\nあの柔軟剤、私も買ったわ。箱で。", "zh": "春香还出了广告呢。\n那款柔顺剂，我也买了。整箱买的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1025_hodogayaimoto", "source_sha256": "c9494a498c7c1fe3af1056d8ab62b957edb04bf570c5aa4e318c3b74b36c29aa", "ja": "柔軟剤を箱で！？　もし未来ちゃんまでCM始めたら\nあの家は足の踏み場もなくなるってこと！？", "zh": "柔顺剂居然要整箱买！？要是连未来都开始拍广告的话，那家里岂不是连落脚的地方都没有了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "7387738ffe4e4182462459d8c55bd97eae4fc5b5ce80384a238400661935411d", "ja": "そ、そんな予定は……\nあはは……。", "zh": "没、没那种安排……\n啊哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "cf0244f35049ab0c303337430fe6a55a32917403a6d1377760cf600285a0250e", "ja": "……はあ。", "zh": "……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "c996833b4ac8061b1cd881cf94687d523f5f79fe30b23c5dbbcd743eee23aeb4", "ja": "未来ちゃん、お疲れさま。\nあのね……。", "zh": "未来，辛苦了。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "24ae7a5ae3260e0d30b893ac85b4a4f43574578ed869c2d4fba3d275dc7bb3fa", "ja": "春香、この後はラジオの収録があるはずだな。\nもう出発しないと間に合わないぞ？", "zh": "春香这之后应该有广播录制吧。\n再不出发就来不及了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "101136f9f0cb4cd1f3235b7871e6214475ef5a0caa3330d0d2613120342b5fc7", "ja": "は、はい。\nあの、でも……。", "zh": "是、是的。\n那个，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "d6d9012df9a4b521a768778d567fff447e45133fada16e4dd9a3a132697b5db8", "ja": "未来の事なら、大丈夫だ。\n話はしておくから、安心して行ってきてくれ。", "zh": "关于未来的事，没问题。\n我会先跟她说一声，你放心去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "8b8ccfcee84f0ac5908fa17c331d9f8407a96b90c9e882582824c58db0628ca4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わかりました。\nじゃあ、私はここで。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我明白了。那我就先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "8b92acc5247a911a3706a1539cc89f75cbe98217c01ddd986d78c20f456d0c53", "ja": "……未来ちゃん！　いってくるね！", "zh": "……未来！我出发了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "aeba70279165ff91c98c33d2aaabf61a4c69014fe37dbc5117066c2ec814d4b6", "ja": "あ、はい！\nいってらっしゃい……！", "zh": "啊，好！\n路上小心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "029a0dfe9af72d6d80f235e618b165f920ea5b6787e8a2aa48c9abf181673672", "ja": "さて……収録も済んだし、劇場に帰ろうか、未来。\n少し話をしよう。", "zh": "那么……录制也结束了，我们回剧场吧，未来。\n聊一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "112865dcf6fa655475314a84b9c893fea3eaf841f2b2093d3f8e77a834a54857", "ja": "話……。", "zh": "谈话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "5e22310d0777275b4da8199bd4daa1643828b3b703f959ea942159a84200d183", "ja": "未来が、少し元気がないように見えたからな。\nちゃんと話を聞いておきたいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "因为看上去未来好像有点没精神。\n所以，我想好好听听她想说什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "bf7e08ffb1d646bd49bc21bb4dbf3a8319332297748e44a886780ed64651534a", "ja": "あ……えへへ。やっぱり、わかっちゃうんですね。\n{$P$}さんには……。", "zh": "啊……嘿嘿。果然还是瞒不过{$P$}先生呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "ee2a3117a0b5846cf7de2d486175228e47993db586d7c46c42afca7fdf5dab72", "ja": "その……やっぱり私、まだまだ\nお仕事もらえてないっていうか……。", "zh": "那个……果然，我还是没接到多少工作，应该说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "998f1da0853541c991661dd27ce82191d0662f438e95ffe1d75bad05748106ca", "ja": "今の仕事は『はるみら』へのオファーが中心で、\n未来個人のものではないしな。", "zh": "现在的工作主要是给『はるみら』的邀约，并不是未来个人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "7331a0a05525a62e8aa97b5a893a55ab09db4630deb097326221b294c5cace39", "ja": "はい。……でも春香さんは、『はるみら』だけでなく、\n個人のお仕事が増えてるから……。", "zh": "是的……但是春香前辈不只是有『はるみら』的工作，个人工作也越来越多了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "d2cbe883493872b9cf82c9cefc4d54bc0c96c5022442827ac852ba6f858c173b", "ja": "やっぱり私は、春香さんの後輩だから\nお仕事もらえてるだけなのかもって……。", "zh": "我总觉得，自己是不是仅仅因为是春香小姐的后辈，\n才能接到工作的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "b7a2c11404d7c53e84b14505e8fdf4d9fef875b2c220c61a88eadbf0145e8790", "ja": "そうだな……安易に答えられる事じゃないけど、\nこう考える事は出来ないかな？", "zh": "是啊……这不是能轻易回答的问题，不过，也可以这样想吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "88beddd4fa75dcc45f9491acee873f5de515b09671bf408b6697413344c6d006", "ja": "春香と未来は、『はるみら』でバズった。\n『はるみら』は、ふたりだから『はるみら』なんだよ。", "zh": "春香和未来，因为『春未』而走红。\n『春未』，正是因为有她们两个人，才成为『春未』的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "8b71c242a454b585cb2ffb87770abbab98fd79f40959d1763c01326a14306344", "ja": "ふたりだから、『はるみら』……。", "zh": "因为是两个人，所以才叫“春未来”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "2d5aca6fb093dc572b84d0addd3eb4316c9fd57445a1c2806f101418c1b5f145", "ja": "この小さな波だけで終ってしまうか、これを\nきっかけとするかは、まだまだこれからだと思う。", "zh": "是就此止步于这朵小小的浪花，还是以此为契机，我觉得一切都还要从现在开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "e796eee9fd300058d5f6391ba8e78569ebec7e693ceca6a4d58d7369aba5c7c5", "ja": "未来と春香には、それぞれ輝くような個性がある。\nそして未来個人を見てくれている人は、ちゃんといる。", "zh": "未来和春香，都有着各自耀眼的个性。\n而且，确实有人一直在关注着未来本人的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1049_p", "source_sha256": "d4b91126e659f28af13c33d7aa6dda9455d6a5a2917d73147f7dc758631c69c6", "ja": "俺は未来の魅力を、信じているからな！", "zh": "因为我相信未来的魅力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1050_014mir", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1051_p", "source_sha256": "0fda3c8cd85c555c7608d60f803299324b0e57925a1e26b512556d2f43fcc397", "ja": "まあ、未来にはもう少し語彙力を\n養ってほしいなとは感じることもあるけど……。", "zh": "不过，有时候我也会觉得，还是希望未来能再多积累一点词汇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "9ec581691021d439729a447784cd2be0ce73478625f9c07571291243cf291642", "ja": "ごいりょく……？", "zh": "词汇量……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1053_p", "source_sha256": "2f56a86250b7b1ab3d2dfd9a292690ed427ed9bf84d6f64946a6dd06b52867d0", "ja": "たくさんの番組に出てわかっただろ？　トークには、\n知識がいる……つまり、学校の勉強は大事ってことだ！", "zh": "上了那么多节目，你也明白了吧？聊天需要知识……也就是说，学校里的学习很重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1054_014mir", "source_sha256": "bb283d434cc52a813c74ca1b90b14587e2f8208c727ad40ffe07772556da026a", "ja": "ううっ……！\nそ、そっちも、がんばりますっ！", "zh": "呜呜……！\n那、那方面我也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1055_001har", "source_sha256": "45c647f4f9f97f09a01f8b2ee54f664224287b87eabe1c07973a7aeeb277d60d", "ja": "戻りました……あの、{$P$}さん。\n未来ちゃんの様子、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "我回来了……那个，{$P$}先生。\n未来她的情况怎么样了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1056_p", "source_sha256": "8478f16fba126ea7842555535ac6e49dac2bea6328d2a08f5a45202fe033bddb", "ja": "おかえり、春香。\nちゃんと話をしたから、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "欢迎回来，春香。\n我已经好好和她谈过了，没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1057_p", "source_sha256": "4ac0303b8f1fb8daa8f11c5386b824d58da5fae0b1b01919e7677686480e6cba", "ja": "それにしても、そんなに心配だったんだな。\n未来の事。", "zh": "不过话说回来，你真的很担心啊。担心未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1058_001har", "source_sha256": "a7c55bb27c48ce2aee5df76555881e7220fd9be8f9534b0b4c5fdee3f06d4b64", "ja": "それは、もちろんです！　だって私は、アイドルとして\n誰かの後輩になったことがないから……。", "zh": "那当然了！因为我作为偶像，从来没有当过谁的后辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1059_001har", "source_sha256": "9748eccb1a230326f534266e6f2172a7d7fbe7d4249d3239e7e82a50063a5b77", "ja": "未来ちゃんの気持ち、ちゃんとわかってるかなって……\n全然、自信がなくって。だから……。", "zh": "我不知道自己是不是真的理解未来的心情……\n完全没有自信。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1060_p", "source_sha256": "021eb550903f36172f1ff57d4d304e5dfb98344cd6cc1b913acba25d59e6efa3", "ja": "なるほど、そうか。\nそういう事なら……。", "zh": "原来如此，是这样啊。\n既然这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_04_1061_p", "source_sha256": "d35b4c60e4d971af662f0f47fcaa2266d550f55467d560a4db406897f7996e18", "ja": "春香、明日は『はるみら』のミーティングがあるだろ？\nふたりに、話しておいてほしい事があって……。", "zh": "春香，明天不是有\"春未来\"的会议吗？\n有些事想请你提前跟她们俩说一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
